# Fresh process, same public fixture; no new draw.
wait
advance
wait
assert snap readings == 3
assert snap reflections == 1
assert text What I must release
assert text operating-system randomness
reveal key reading-context reading-context
settle 2
capture reopened-reading
reveal key reading-narrative reading-narrative
settle 2
capture reopened-narration
resize 420 760
wait
reveal key scene-card scene-card:next_step
settle 2
assert visible key scene-card scene-card:next_step
capture reopened-compact-card
